49-**Semantic:** `convergenceThreshold` compares newly discovered information against accumulated research knowledge with negative-knowledge emphasis. Lower = more iterations / higher signal threshold.
50-
51-**NOT INTERCHANGEABLE with siblings:**
52-- `deep-review` uses 0.10 default on weighted P0/P1/P2 severity ratio
53-- `deep-ai-council` uses 0.20 default on adjudicator-verdict stability
54-
