            redispatch_once: "On the FIRST failure of the mechanical command check for this iteration, re-run step_dispatch_iteration exactly once for the same iteration number, then re-run the check. If it still fails, record the iteration as error and continue. Never re-dispatch a given iteration more than once."
            escalation: "After 3 consecutive failures across iterations, trigger stuck_recovery event with diagnostic context"
